<body><p>Dear #if($user.firstName!='') $user.firstName #end #if($user.lastName!='') $user.lastName #end,</p><br/>

<p>Please be advised that $INVOICE_TYPE No. $INVOICE_NUMBER has been saved and an email notification with
    $TYPE attached, in PDF form, has been sent to $CLIENT_CONTACT_NAME on $DATE.
    You can find the message that was sent to $CLIENT_CONTACT_NAME below.
    The $INVOICE_TYPE is also attached for your attention.</p>

##$companyInfo

<p>_______________________________________________________________________________________________</p>

<p>$MESSAGE</p>

##<p>
##---------------------------------------<br />
##Powered by WorkforceTrack.com
##</p>

</body>
</html>